# Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd: "return that card to the battlefield" -- a token that is exiled ceases to exist (CR 111.7,
# 704.5d), so there is no card to return. Bot1's Malevolent Rumble makes an Eldrazi Spawn on turn 1; on turn 3 Phelia attacks and
# exiles it. At the end step it does not come back, and since nothing entered under Bot1's control Phelia gets no counter.

